  "prefLabel": "Gcd 402.04 Registration tag",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 402.04 “Registration tag” means a small tag issued by the commission and affixed to the service animal which states “ GCD – Permanent Registration” and which has a unique number.\n\nSource. #10341, eff 5-17-13; ss by #13811, eff 11-23-23",
